    "turn_text": "These are decisions that are basically made at the local level. You know, what we can control is the amount, you know, we don't want people who are coming back who are positive for COVID. The director is no longer on the phone, I don't think. Eric, she's not on the phone. That is a question. One of the things that we decide today, the director had to go, but the director is available if you want to call the director this afternoon. The director can give you answers to any of those questions. I would just say about the testing. We're going to follow the health department and the best medical advice we can get about testing. If testing helps with any inmate, we are going to test. I've given the authority to DRC to test as many people as they think or makes a difference. And so it will be as aggressive testing as is medically indicated. So that's wide open. Again, they're going to follow the best medical advice on that.",
