    "turn_idx": 84,
    "turn_text": "Hi, Governor, Andy Chow with Ohio Public Radio and Television, State House News Bureau. I wanted to revisit the issue of testing capacity versus how many tests are actually administered a day. Where's the state going with that? What's being done to make sure that the state's actually doing the test that it has a capacity to do?",
