        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "A discrepancy between capacity and actual usage indicates a systemic inefficiency.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The public expects transparency and accountability from government officials on health metrics.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
